          "label": "证明 $\\det(T_n) = n+1$",
          "steps": [
            "设 $\\delta_n = \\det(T_n)$，按第 $n$ 行展开：",
            "$\\delta_n = 2 \\cdot M_{n,n} - (-1) \\cdot M_{n,n-1} = 2\\delta_{n-1} + \\delta_{n-2}$",
            "初值：$\\delta_1 = 2$，$\\delta_2 = \\det\\begin{pmatrix} 2 & -1 \\\\ -1 & 2 \\end{pmatrix} = 4 - 1 = 3$",
            "计算：$\\delta_3 = 2 \\cdot 3 + 2 = 8$... 不对，$\\delta_3 = 2 \\cdot 3 - (-1)^2 \\delta_1 = 6 - 2 = 4$（重新检查）",
            "重新：按第1行展开 $\\delta_n = 2\\delta_{n-1} - (-1)^{1+n} \\delta_{n-2} = 2\\delta_{n-1} - (-1)^{n+1}\\delta_{n-2}$",
            "对于 $n=3$：$\\delta_3 = 2 \\cdot 3 - (-1)^4 \\cdot 2 = 6 - 2 = 4 = 3+1$ ✓",
            "猜想：$\\delta_n = n+1$",
            "**数学归纳法**：假设 $\\delta_k = k+1$ 对 $k \\leq n$ 成立，需证 $\\delta_{n+1} = n+2$",
            "$\\delta_{n+1} = 2\\delta_n - (-1)^{n+2}\\delta_{n-1} = 2(n+1) - (-1)^{n+2} \\cdot n$",
            "当 $n$ 为偶数时，$\\delta_{n+1} = 2(n+1) - n = n+2$ ✓",
            "当 $n$ 为奇数时，$\\delta_{n+1} = 2(n+1) + n = 3n+2$... 需重新验证递推关系"
